      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "cephfs (iso)\n  lightwhale-3.0.5-x86.iso   -> cdrom, boots the VM\n  lightwhale-magic.img       -> imported as the VM disk\nceph-vm (rbd)\n  20 GB disk per VM, formatted by lightwhale",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "cephfs (iso)\n  lightwhale-3.0.5-x86.iso   -> cdrom, boots the VM\n  lightwhale-magic.img       -> imported as the VM disk\nceph-vm (rbd)\n  20 GB disk per VM, formatted by lightwhale",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
