      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "lightwhale, booted from ISO\n/dev/sda2  docker data root\n  (magic header -> formatted\n   on the very first boot)\neth0  LAN, default route\neth1  ceph network\n/mnt/cephfs  via /etc/fstab",
